{
  "_instructions": [
    "Copy this file to infra/params.json and fill in your values.",
    "params.json is gitignored and must NEVER be committed.",
    "",
    "Prerequisites (not created by the template): the GitHub OIDC identity provider",
    "(token.actions.githubusercontent.com), an ACM certificate in us-east-1 covering",
    "the domain and www, the Route 53 hosted zone, and optionally a WAF web ACL.",
    "",
    "Deploy commands (the log handler Lambda code is packaged from lambda/):",
    "  aws cloudformation package --template-file infra/template.yaml \\",
    "    --s3-bucket <ARTIFACT-BUCKET> --output-template-file /tmp/utopia-packaged.yaml",
    "  aws cloudformation deploy --template-file /tmp/utopia-packaged.yaml \\",
    "    --stack-name utopia-formatter --capabilities CAPABILITY_NAMED_IAM \\",
    "    --parameter-overrides $(jq -r 'to_entries|map(select(.key|startswith(\"_\")|not))|map(\"\\(.key)=\\(.value)\")|.[]' infra/params.json)",
    "",
    "Then retrieve the outputs to configure GitHub Secrets:",
    "  aws cloudformation describe-stacks --stack-name utopia-formatter \\",
    "    --query 'Stacks[0].Outputs' --output table",
    "",
    "Required GitHub Secrets (Settings → Secrets → Actions):",
    "  AWS_ROLE_ARN        ← output GitHubActionsRoleArn",
    "  AWS_ROLE_ARN_DEV    ← output GitHubActionsRoleDevArn",
    "  AWS_REGION          ← the region you deployed to",
    "  S3_BUCKET_PROD      ← output SiteBucketName",
    "  S3_BUCKET_DEV       ← output SiteBucketName (dev deploys go under dev/)",
    "  CLOUDFRONT_ID_PROD  ← output DistributionId",
    "  CLOUDFRONT_ID_DEV   ← output DistributionId",
    "  LOG_ENDPOINT        ← output LogEndpoint",
    "",
    "Required GitHub environments (Settings → Environments):",
    "  production  — deployment branches: main only",
    "  development — no restrictions"
  ],

  "GitHubOrg":          "YOUR-GITHUB-USERNAME-OR-ORG",
  "GitHubRepo":         "UtopiaFormatter",
  "DomainName":         "example.com",
  "AcmCertificateArn":  "arn:aws:acm:us-east-1:111122223333:certificate/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "HostedZoneId":       "Z0123456789EXAMPLE",
  "WebAclArn":          "",
  "SiteBucketName":     "your-site-bucket",
  "LogBucketName":      "your-log-bucket",
  "AdminPrincipalArns": "arn:aws:iam::111122223333:root,arn:aws:iam::111122223333:user/your-admin-user"
}
